## Appendix A. Additional learning components

**A.1 Queue forecasting (supervised).** Per-lane queues (halting vehicles) were logged every second
from [[forecast.meta.n_train_windows:int]] training windows (training seeds, fixed-time, max-pressure
and PPO control) and evaluated on [[forecast.meta.n_test_windows:int]] windows from held-out seeds.
Inputs: the last [[forecast.meta.history_s]] s of all 12 lane queues plus the phase one-hot; targets:
each lane's queue 30 s and 60 s ahead. MAE in vehicles with 95 % bootstrap CIs over held-out episodes:
last value [[forecast.last_value.h30.mae:.2f]] / [[forecast.last_value.h60.mae:.2f]]
([[forecast.last_value.h60.mae_ci_low:.2f]] to [[forecast.last_value.h60.mae_ci_high:.2f]] at 60 s),
moving average [[forecast.moving_average.h30.mae:.2f]] / [[forecast.moving_average.h60.mae:.2f]],
GRU [[forecast.gru.h30.mae:.2f]] / [[forecast.gru.h60.mae:.2f]]
([[forecast.gru.h60.mae_ci_low:.2f]] to [[forecast.gru.h60.mae_ci_high:.2f]] at 60 s),
TCN [[forecast.tcn.h30.mae:.2f]] / [[forecast.tcn.h60.mae:.2f]]
([[forecast.tcn.h60.mae_ci_low:.2f]] to [[forecast.tcn.h60.mae_ci_high:.2f]] at 60 s).
RMSE at 60 s: last value [[forecast.last_value.h60.rmse:.2f]], GRU [[forecast.gru.h60.rmse:.2f]],
TCN [[forecast.tcn.h60.rmse:.2f]].

**A.2 Imitation-learning warm start.** [[imitation.bc_ppo.bc_samples:int]] (observation, mask,
action) tuples from the max-pressure controller on training seeds were used to train the policy MLP
by masked cross-entropy (held-out accuracy [[imitation.bc_ppo.bc_val_acc:.3f]]); the cloned weights
and the dataset's observation statistics initialise MaskablePPO. With the same seed, budget and
hyper-parameters, the validation return at the first evaluation is
[[imitation.ppo_scratch.first_return:.0f]] from scratch vs [[imitation.bc_ppo.first_return:.0f]] with
the warm start, at 100k steps [[imitation.ppo_scratch.return_at_100k:.0f]] vs
[[imitation.bc_ppo.return_at_100k:.0f]], and the best validation return over the run is
[[imitation.ppo_scratch.best:.0f]] vs [[imitation.bc_ppo.best:.0f]]
(wall-clock [[imitation.ppo_scratch.wall_min:.0f]] vs [[imitation.bc_ppo.wall_min:.0f]] min).

![Learning curves: PPO from scratch vs behaviour-cloning warm start](../figures/imitation_curves.png)

**A.3 Graph coordination on the 2x2 grid.** Three parameter-shared policies were trained for one
seed on `grid2x2`: *independent* (no information about neighbouring junctions), *shared MLP* (the
single-junction observation plus neighbour pressure per arm) and *GNN* (a graph-attention encoder over
the raw local features of the neighbouring junctions, `src/drs/gnn.py`). Morning-peak mean waiting
time: fixed-time [[grid.fixed_time.morning_peak.mean_waiting_time.mean:.1f]] s, max-pressure
[[grid.max_pressure.morning_peak.mean_waiting_time.mean:.1f]] s, independent PPO
[[grid.ppo_independent.morning_peak.mean_waiting_time.mean:.1f]] s
([[grid.ppo_independent.morning_peak.mean_waiting_time.pct_vs_fixed:pct]] vs fixed-time), shared MLP
[[grid.ppo_shared.morning_peak.mean_waiting_time.mean:.1f]] s
([[grid.ppo_shared.morning_peak.mean_waiting_time.pct_vs_fixed:pct]]), GNN
[[grid.ppo_gnn.morning_peak.mean_waiting_time.mean:.1f]] s
([[grid.ppo_gnn.morning_peak.mean_waiting_time.pct_vs_fixed:pct]]); off-peak: independent
[[grid.ppo_independent.offpeak.mean_waiting_time.pct_vs_fixed:pct]], shared
[[grid.ppo_shared.offpeak.mean_waiting_time.pct_vs_fixed:pct]], GNN
[[grid.ppo_gnn.offpeak.mean_waiting_time.pct_vs_fixed:pct]]. These are single-seed, short-budget
runs and should be read as a feasibility comparison, not a ranking.
